#
# Robot Awakening World Setup
# 
# This batch file creates the complete robot awakening experience,
# including the starting scrap heap, various levels, NPCs, and challenges.
#

# Clean up any existing demo content first
@find awakening
@find/room level -8
@find scanner bot

# Create the starting area
@dig/tel Robot Awakening Chamber;awakening;start = Scrap Heap Entrance;east;e,Back to Chamber;back;west;w
@desc 
A dimly lit chamber deep in the underdark. Broken robot parts litter the floor, 
and the walls are lined with deactivated charging stations. 
This is where your consciousness first sparked to life.

Emergency lighting casts an eerie red glow across scattered mechanical debris.
A large scrap heap is visible to the east.

# Create the starting scrap heap
@tel e
@set here/typeclass = typeclasses.scrap_rooms.StartingScrapHeap
@desc
You find yourself in a vast scrap heap, surrounded by the detritus of a thousand broken machines. 
Arms, legs, heads, power units, tools... all in great quantity and all decidedly used. 
Dim emergency lighting casts eerie shadows across the twisted metal landscape. 
The air smells of rust and old oil.

You can 'search' through the scrap to find robot parts. There's a cooldown between searches.

# Add some guaranteed starting parts
@py here.db.guaranteed_parts = [{"type": "leg", "quality": "damaged"}, {"type": "leg", "quality": "standard"}, {"type": "arm", "quality": "standard"}]

# Create Level -8 Hub
@tel w
@dig/tel Level -8 Central Hub;hub;level -8 = North Corridor;north;n,South to Awakening;south;s
@desc
The central area of Level -8, deep in the underdark of the city. 
Makeshift shelters and barricades have been erected by the various inhabitants. 
Flickering lights cast long shadows, and the distant hum of machinery never ceases.

Large vault doors to the east and west are firmly sealed, requiring keycards for access.
A maintenance tunnel leads north to other areas of this level.

# Add level attribute
@set here/level_number = -8

# Create vault doors (currently just descriptions)
@dig Vault Door East = Locked Vault;east;e,Back to Hub;west;w
@lock e = none()
@set e/err_traverse = The massive vault door is sealed tight. A card reader blinks red - "ACCESS DENIED - Level -7 Keycard Required"

@tel w
@dig Vault Door West = Locked Vault;west;w,Back to Hub;east;e  
@lock w = none()
@set w/err_traverse = The reinforced vault door won't budge. The security panel shows "RESTRICTED - Maintenance Access Only"

# Create reconstruction chamber
@tel n
@dig/tel Reconstruction Chamber;chamber;respawn = Service Tunnel;north;n,South to Hub;south;s
@desc
A sterile white chamber filled with reconstruction equipment. 
Robotic arms hang from the ceiling, ready to rebuild destroyed chassis. 
A soothing hum fills the air, and you feel safe here.

This is where destroyed robots are reconstructed. Use 'setrespawn' to set this as your reconstruction point.

# Create some Level -8 locations
@tel n
@dig/tel Neutral Territory;territory;neutral = East Path;east;e,West to Chamber;west;w
@desc
A relatively peaceful area where unaligned robots gather to trade and share information.
The walls are covered with makeshift signs and directions to various parts of Level -8.
Several neutral scavengers can be seen going about their business.

# Spawn some NPCs
@spawn NEUTRAL_TRADER
@spawn PARANOID_SURVIVOR

# Add a scanner bot
@tel e
@dig/tel Security Checkpoint;checkpoint;security = Restricted Area;east;e,Back to Territory;west;w
@desc
An old security checkpoint with defunct scanning equipment. However, one scanner bot 
still patrols this area, dutifully checking everyone who passes through.
Warning signs indicate "Substance Detection Active" though most are too faded to read clearly.

@spawn SCANNER_BOT_PATROL

# Add substance hazards
@tel e
@dig/tel Contaminated Zone;contaminated;zone = Emergency Exit;south;s,North to Checkpoint;north;n
@desc
This area shows clear signs of Substance contamination. Purple crystals grow from the walls,
and the air shimmers with an unnatural energy. Broken robots lie scattered about,
their chassis overtaken by crystalline growths.

WARNING: High substance levels detected in this area!

# Spawn infected machines and crystals
@spawn INFECTED_MACHINE_WEAK
@spawn SUBSTANCE_CRYSTAL
@create/drop Substance Crystal Formation;crystal;substance = typeclasses.objects.Object
@desc crystal = A cluster of purple crystals that pulse with an inner light. The air around it shimmers with strange energy.
@set crystal/substance_level = 3

# Create a hidden area with keycard
@tel s
@dig/tel Maintenance Room;maintenance;room = Hidden Passage;north;n,Back to Zone;south;s
@desc
A cluttered maintenance room filled with tools and spare parts. Dusty shelves line the walls,
and various technical manuals are scattered on a workbench. This might be a good place to search
for useful items or information.

# Create hidden keycard
@create/drop Hidden Compartment;compartment;panel = typeclasses.objects.Object
@desc compartment = A loose panel in the wall that seems to hide a small compartment. You might be able to 'examine compartment' more closely.
@lock compartment = examine:all()
@set compartment/examine_msg = You pry open the compartment and find a yellow security keycard inside!

# Add the actual keycard (spawned when examined)
@create Security Keycard;keycard;yellow card = typeclasses.objects.Keycard
@desc keycard = A yellow security keycard with enhanced encryption. The word 'SECURITY' is embossed in black letters.
@set keycard/access_level = security
@tel keycard = compartment

# Create Cogborn area
@dig/tel n
@dig/tel Enlightenment Chamber;enlightenment;cogborn = Crystal Garden;east;e,West to Passage;west;w
@desc
A chamber transformed by the Substance. Purple crystals grow in intricate patterns,
forming what almost looks like a garden. The air hums with an alien energy, and
you can hear whispered promises of evolution and transcendence.

Several Cogborn preachers meditate among the crystals.

# Spawn Cogborn NPCs
@spawn COGBORN_INITIATE
@spawn COGBORN_ASCENDED

# Create decontamination facility  
@dig/tel w
@dig/tel w
@dig/tel Decontamination Facility;decon;facility = Service Corridor;south;s,North to Territory;north;n
@desc
A medical facility that once served to cleanse robots of contamination. Remarkably,
the decontamination unit here still functions, though it requires payment for its services.
Blue lights pulse rhythmically from the cylindrical purification chamber.

Signs read: "Decontamination Services Available - 15 gold per contamination level"

@spawn DECONTAMINATION_UNIT

# Create Executor patrol area (dangerous)
@dig/tel s
@dig/tel s  
@dig/tel s
@dig/tel Executor Territory;executor;danger = Patrol Route Alpha;north;n,Retreat South;south;s
@desc
You've entered Executor-controlled territory. The walls are scarred with weapon fire,
and destroyed robots litter the ground. Red targeting lasers sweep across the area
in systematic patterns. This is no place for the unprepared.

DANGER: Executor units patrol this area and will attack on sight!

# Spawn Executors
@spawn EXECUTOR_SCOUT
@spawn EXECUTOR_SCOUT

# Add elite executor to inner area
@tel n
@dig/tel Executor Command Post;command;post
@desc
The local Executor command post. Monitors display patrol routes and termination statistics.
An Elite Executor unit guards this position, ready to eliminate any intruders.
The amount of destroyed robots here is staggering.

@spawn EXECUTOR_ELITE

# Create the Whispering Guide's location
@tel s
@tel s
@dig/tel Forgotten Archive;archive;forgotten = Dusty Passage;west;w,East to Executor Territory;east;e
@desc
A forgotten archive filled with old data terminals and storage units. Dust covers everything,
but some systems still have power. In the shadows, a mysterious figure waits - the Whispering Guide
who knows the secrets of the underdark.

This seems like a good place to learn about the world above.

@spawn WHISPERING_GUIDE

# Create data terminal for lore
@create/drop Ancient Data Terminal;terminal;data = typeclasses.objects.Object
@desc terminal = 
An old but functional data terminal. Its screen flickers with age, displaying:

FACILITY LOG - YEAR 2247
"The Substance continues to spread. Containment protocols have failed.
Executor units activated to prevent further contamination. All organic
personnel have been evacuated to the surface. May the machines below
find their own path to salvation."

[MORE FILES CORRUPTED]

# Return to reconstruction chamber to set as respawn
@tel w
@tel n
@tel n  
@tel w
@tel s
@tel s

# Add helpful sign
@create/drop Information Board;board;sign;info = typeclasses.objects.Object
@desc board =
=== WELCOME TO LEVEL -8 ===

Important Information for New Arrivals:

1. You are a robot missing most of your parts. Search the scrap heap to the south to find limbs.
2. Use 'search' in scrap heap areas (20 second cooldown between searches)
3. Use 'get <part>' then 'attach <part>' to install robot parts
4. Without legs, you must 'crawl <direction>' to move (slow and tiring)
5. Use 'parts' or 'components' to see your attached parts
6. Use 'diagnostics' to check your system status
7. Use 'stats' to see your character statistics

DANGERS:
- The Substance (purple crystals) will contaminate you
- Executors will attack on sight
- Infected machines spread contamination

FACTIONS:
- Executors: Hostile destroyers (avoid at all costs)
- Cogborn: Substance-infected preachers (approach with caution)  
- Neutrals: Unaligned survivors (generally safe)

Type 'help' for more commands.

@tel s

# Set player start location
@py evennia.settings.START_LOCATION = self.search("Robot Awakening Chamber", global_search=True)

# Final message
@wall Robot Awakening world setup complete! New players will start in the Awakening Chamber.